OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says his government has
OL,7,F"big decisions" to make on council
OL,8,Ftax, as he criticised the unfairness
OL,9,Fof the current system.
OL,11,FThe prime minister acknowledged he
OL,12,Fneeded to stick to Labour's manifesto
OL,13,Fcommitments from the 2024 election but
OL,14,Fadded he understood why people felt
OL,15,Fthe current system was
OL,16,Fdisproportionate.
OL,18,FThe debate comes as No 10 denied
OL,19,Fspeculation that the government was
OL,20,Fconsidering replacing council tax and
OL,21,Fstamp duty with a land value tax.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
