CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785190687
OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,FSpeaking to Laura Kuenssberg on the
OL,7,FBBC's Panorama programme, Burnham
OL,8,Fsaid: "There are people here in
OL,9,FGreater Manchester who pay a much
OL,10,Fhigher council tax than people living
OL,11,Fin much larger homes in London.
OL,13,F"So the chancellor before, Rachel
OL,14,FReeves, was right to start to reform
OL,15,Fcouncil tax to create some fairness
OL,16,Fthere in relation to people in homes
OL,17,Fthat are of much greater value, who
OL,18,Fhaven't seen their council tax go up
OL,19,Fover the years because of the failure
OL,20,Fto revalue the banding.
OL,26,@pD@GOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785190687
OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,F"So that's an example of something
OL,7,Fthat I think was right and fair."
OL,9,FA spokesperson for No 10 said that any
OL,10,Ftax decisions are reserved for fiscal
OL,11,Fevents and insisted it was not right
OL,12,Ffor them to comment outside of those
OL,13,Fcircumstances.
OL,15,FThis means there will not be a full
OL,16,Fupdate on tax until Burnham's first
OL,17,Fbudget, which will likely be in
OL,18,FOctober.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
