OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe prime minister acknowledged that
OL,12,Fany major changes to taxes would be
OL,13,Fquestioned to see if they were
OL,14,Fconsistent with the manifesto.
OL,16,FHe said: "We need to honour the
OL,17,Fmanifesto upon which Labour was
OL,18,Felected, and if I was to bring forward
OL,19,Fany changes, obviously people would
OL,20,Frightly say, well, is this consistent
OL,21,Fwith that manifesto?
OL,26,@xD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
