PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785190687
OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,F"So there are big decisions ahead, you
OL,7,Fare right about that."
OL,9,FBurnham has previously said he has
OL,10,Fbeen "persuaded" in the argument for
OL,11,Freforming the council tax system.
OL,13,FDespite this, No 10 denied reports by
OL,14,FThe i Paper that Burnham was
OL,15,Fconsidering replacing council tax and
OL,16,Fstamp duty with a 0.48% annual charge
OL,17,Fon a home's current value, which is
OL,18,Fconsidered a land value tax.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
