OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,FAccording to the Fairer Share
OL,7,FCampaign, the flat-rate annual charge
OL,8,Fcould save households in areas such as
OL,9,FHartlepool about #950 a year.
OL,11,FStamp duty is paid on house sales
OL,12,Fworth more than #125,000, although
OL,13,Ffirst-time buyers do not have to pay
OL,14,Fanything on purchases up to #300,00.
OL,15,FThe relief ends at prices over
OL,16,F#500,000.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
