OL,3,CBurnham says 'big decisions' ahead on
OL,4,Ccouncil tax
OL,6,FJust a week after the former mayor of
OL,7,FGreater Manchester took over as prime
OL,8,Fminister, Labour has taken the lead
OL,9,Ffor the first time since March 2025 in
OL,10,Fa More in Common poll released on
OL,11,FMonday.
OL,13,FThe 'Burnham bounce' shows Labour up
OL,14,Ffour percentage points to 28, with
OL,15,FReform on 24.
OL,17,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,18,Four political experts are across all
OL,19,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,20,Fto the latest episode below...
